<title>Italy: CYCLING-CIPOLLINI WINS FOURTH STAGE OF GIRO.</title>
<headline>CYCLING-CIPOLLINI WINS FOURTH STAGE OF GIRO.</headline>
<dateline>AREZZO, Italy 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italy's Mario Cipollini won the fourth stage of the Giro d'Italia cycle race on Tuesday, according to provisional results.  </p>
<p>Endrio Leoni of Italy was second and Spain's Angel Edo third.</p>
<p>Pavel Tonkov of Russia retains the overall race leader's pink jersey.</p>
</text>
